flowchart TB
    PM["/3c-project-manager plan<br/><i>reads every issue in the milestone together</i>"]

    CONTRA["1. Contradictions<br/><i>two issues require opposite things</i>"]
    SHARED["2. Shared surfaces<br/><i>two issues edit the same file</i>"]
    ORDER["3. Dependency order<br/><i>a premise sequenced after its dependent</i>"]
    DUP["4. Duplicate or overlapping scope<br/><i>one piece of work, two names</i>"]
    ASSUME["5. Load-bearing assumptions<br/><i>a claim about the code that is no longer true</i>"]

    HOLD["⚠️ 1 issue held<br/><i>a human resolves or defers it</i>"]
    READY["✅ Coherent sprint<br/><i>merged, sequenced, rewritten</i>"]

    PM --> CONTRA
    PM --> SHARED
    PM --> ORDER
    PM --> DUP
    PM --> ASSUME

    CONTRA --> READY
    SHARED --> READY
    ORDER --> READY
    DUP --> READY
    ASSUME --> HOLD
